-- awards of HLstatsX:CE (sql/install.sql of
-- github.com/A1mDev/hlstatsx-community-edition, GPL-2.0-or-later) next to
-- the teams, history awards, ranks and ribbon classes above. Changed: CE's
-- player-vs-player awards (type P) and its own latency award are left out
-- (Best Latency above covers it), the misspelled "Tounge Twister"
-- descriptions read "Tongue Twister" (the action code stays
-- tounge_twister, as the plugin logs it), and two copy errors of l4d2 are
-- fixed (killed_jockey was named "Hunter Punter", protect_teammate counted
-- "hunter punts"). One ribbon per new daily award.
